# Compiled binaries (these were previously committed — remove them from the
# index with:  git rm --cached Running_time test test_noomp running_time)
#
# LEADING SLASH MATTERS. Unanchored, `test` matches a directory of that name at
# ANY depth, which silently swallowed the whole of gpu/test/ — source files and
# all — because git never mentions what it is ignoring.
/Running_time
/running_time
/test
/test_noomp
*.o
*.out
a.out

/validate
/numpy_validate

